            },
            "reviewBody": "I have been using mayonnaise and parmesan for years! I don't take the leaves off the cobs. Just grill them until the leaves are all black, peel them off, and then spread the mayo and parm on them. Now, I will add chili powder as well!!!!",
            "datePublished": "2025-07-01T14:49:56.614Z"
